{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38880","headline":"题宗上人旧院 · 杜荀鹤","name":"题宗上人旧院","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"此院重来事事乖，半欹茅屋草侵堦。\n啄生鸦忆啼松枿，接果猿思啸石崖。\n壁上尘黏蒲叶扇，牀前苔烂笋皮鞋。\n分明记得谈空日，不向秋风更怆怀。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杜荀鹤","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_38880.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_38880","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}